iPSX2 — NOTICE OF MODIFICATION
================================

iPSX2 is a modified version of PCSX2, via the ARM64/Android port ARMSX2.
It is not the official PCSX2 or ARMSX2 project. Please report bugs specific
to iPSX2 here rather than to either upstream project.

Modified by: iPSX2 project contributors
Modified since: March 2026 (ongoing)
Upstream: PCSX2 — https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2
Intermediate project: ARMSX2 (ARM64 / Android port)
License: GPL-3.0-or-later — see LICENSE

The iPSX2 project has:
- Ported the emulator to iPhone, iPad and Apple silicon, including a SwiftUI
  application, Objective-C++ bridge, input and rendering integrations.
- Added an interpreter-based execution path for EE, IOP, VU0 and VU1,
  designed to operate without runtime-generated machine code.
- Changed emulator settings, platform integration, and application features.
- Experimented with offline translation of VU1 microprograms. Generated,
  game-derived `iv2_t1_*.inc` files are NOT part of this public source tree;
  the source supports interpreter fallback without them.

